{
  "comment": [
    "Cross-runtime LSP conformance fixtures (design §13): executed by",
    "ts/test/conformance.test.js, go/conformance_test.go and",
    "rs/tests/conformance_test.rs against the shared pure-data grammar",
    "(json-grammar.json). Values were derived from the canonical",
    "TypeScript pipeline; a Go or Rust mismatch is a port defect, not a",
    "fixture update — TS is canonical. Positions are LSP units: 0-based",
    "lines, UTF-16 characters. codes lists every diagnostic's code in",
    "order; firstRange pins the first diagnostic's converted range (the",
    "astral case is why it exists); outline is the nested symbol-name",
    "tree; completions list sorted item labels. semantic pins the",
    "semantic tokens of the reconciled lex trace: errors is the parse's",
    "error count, tokens the decoded [line, character, length, type]",
    "rows (a token spanning lines is one row per line), data the LSP",
    "delta-encoded form over the fixed legend; overrides, when present,",
    "is the entry's semanticTokens map."
  ],
